# tabctl CLI contract: stdout and exit status.
# Three mediators: Firefox, a second Firefox profile (Firefox2), and Zen.
# stderr is not part of the contract and is not recorded.

## Listing

$ tabctl list
firefox.1.10	Inbox (3), Mail	https://mail.example/inbox
firefox.1.11	日本語 ✓ café 🦊	https://unicode.example/%E8%B7%AF?q=1&x=2
firefox.1.12		about:blank
firefox.2.20	Second window	https://two.example/
firefox2.7.70	Profile Two	https://p2.example/
zen.3.30	Zen	https://zen.example/
[exit 0]

$ tabctl list --format tsv
firefox.1.10	Inbox (3), Mail	https://mail.example/inbox
firefox.1.11	日本語 ✓ café 🦊	https://unicode.example/%E8%B7%AF?q=1&x=2
firefox.1.12		about:blank
firefox.2.20	Second window	https://two.example/
firefox2.7.70	Profile Two	https://p2.example/
zen.3.30	Zen	https://zen.example/
[exit 0]

